			"Message": "chore(Land): Sync Element submodules to enforce PascalCase naming and consolidate lint configs\n\nUpdate the `Element` git submodule from `7d937e8d` to `efb7012e` to align with the project-wide strict PascalCase naming convention across all Rust-based editor components.\n\nThe update removes blanket `#![allow(non_snake_case)]` and related directives from `Air`, `Common`, `Mountain`, `SideCar`, and `Echo`. These suppressions previously masked violations in functions, variables, and structs. Specific changes include:\n- **Mist:** Consolidate remaining lint exceptions into `lib.rs`.\n- **Grove:** Retain specific FFI allowances in `main.rs` only.\n- **Vine:** Strip generated suppressions from gRPC bindings (`Mountain` IPC).\n- **Maintain & Echo:** Sync Rust documentation submodules to Nightly 1.97.0.\n- **Sky:** Merge to align with current branch state.\n\nThis ensures lints are active for standard identifiers, centralizes necessary FFI exceptions, and unifies codebase styling.",
			"SHA": "b23f8efc45f1c12aaff2736ba8ac0575b9ae35a7"
		},
